1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
The biggest mistake people make during a dispute is trusting their memory.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Days later, screenshots are buried and details start to fade.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Instead of trying to remember later, document it immediately.

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Proof organizes everything into one timeline with timestamps.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Lock the facts before memory changes.
